                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \delta: R[ [X] ] \to R[ [X] ] \otimes_R D \cong R[ [X] ][\varepsilon]/(\varepsilon^2)
            be the unique topological
            = succeed "-algebra" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
