          %p
            One may then apply
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coinduction"} coinductive
            techniques to prove various facts. One illustration is given
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coinduction#Examples"} here
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo +
                  %mi x
                  %msup
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mi r
                  %mo ≔
                  %mi exp
