          %h3#purely_real_and_purely_infinitesimal_elements Purely real and purely infinitesimal elements
          %p
            Suppose that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
